#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:417 8e6441ca6c89453a8e8432f5ee22999c
msgid ""
"The UART7 connector is labeled debug, but is available as a general purpose "
"UART with ArduPilot."
msgstr "UART7 接头标注为调试，但在 ArduPilot 中可作为通用 UART 使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:421 d15d9e14b80e4c919a6e22e728f764d9
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:423 6d66da2ac3c946238cf4882870c7a6e4
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the PPM pin, at one end of the servo rail, marked "
"RC in the above diagram. This pin supports all unidirectional RC protocols "
"including PPM.  The DSM/SBUS pin is also tied to the PPM pin. For "
"CRSF/ELRS/etc. protocols, a full UART will need to be used with its "
"SERIALx_PROTOCOL set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 PPM 引脚上，位于舵机轨一端，在上图中标注为 RC。该引脚支持所有单向 RC 协议（包括 PPM）。DSM/SBUS 引脚同样与 "
"PPM 引脚相连。对于 CRSF/ELRS 等协议，需使用完整的 UART，并将其 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 设为「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:426 74a947e2e5c843719596c5161201bb37
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:428 f423bd057df74a0eb9f960a7173b77b6
msgid ""
"The MUPilot supports up to 14 PWM outputs. First first 8 outputs (labeled "
"\"M1 to M8\") are controlled by a dedicated STM32F103 IO controller. These 8"
" outputs support all PWM output formats, but not DShot."
msgstr ""
"MUPilot 最多支持 14 路 PWM 输出。前 8 路输出（标注为「M1 至 M8」）由专用的 STM32F103 IO 控制器控制。这 8 "
"路输出支持所有 PWM 输出格式，但不支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:432 adf94811ba554f5dadc5804555466bfa
msgid ""
"The remaining 6 outputs (labeled A1 to A6) are the \"auxiliary\" outputs. "
"These are directly attached to the STM32F765 and support all PWM protocols "
"as well as DShot."
msgstr "其余 6 路输出（标注为 A1 至 A6）为「辅助」输出，直接连接至 STM32F765，支持所有 PWM 协议及 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:436 97e939fff5ce42dfaf1cad49ae4d6410
msgid ""
"All 14 PWM outputs have GND on the top row, 5V on the middle row and signal "
"on the bottom row."
msgstr "全部 14 路 PWM 输出的顶行为 GND，中行为 5V，底行为信号线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:439 6c25abde53c144869b0ee3ab3d4e4561
msgid "The 8 main PWM outputs are in 3 groups:"
msgstr "8 路主 PWM 输出分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:441 f735c5bda9274abe853040555cacdd80
msgid "PWM 1 and 2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 属于第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:442 43265492bd404149a6bd3576701132fc
msgid "PWM 3 and 4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 属于第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:443 5a8eb11c4d434912a7d6d0e95d47f5b4
msgid "PWM 5, 6, 7 and 8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5、6、7、8 属于第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:445 1073686816574032beaf1aa3f49a59f6
msgid "The 6 auxiliary PWM outputs are in 2 groups:"
msgstr "6 路辅助 PWM 输出分为 2 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:447 10e9f32a38f04d60a8a0334adf62d754
msgid "PWM 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2、3、4 属于第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:448 dabb382c01144afa922fc73c7579612b
msgid "PWM 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 属于第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:450 9956a92b02104a5ba90ffb12b9286511
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:454 5f6e75011f6845518a384a0b04bb5767
msgid ""
"The output levels of the auxiliary outputs can be selected by switch to be "
"either 3.3V or 5V. The output level is 3.3V for the main outputs."
msgstr "辅助输出的输出电平可通过开关选择 3.3V 或 5V。主输出的输出电平为 3.3V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:457 e1e7212050a444a2946aaa559397cd74
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:458 a79d1e308910460287254f974e100520
msgid ""
"The board has two dedicated power monitor ports on 6 pin connectors. The "
"correct battery setting parameters are dependent on the type of power brick "
"which is connected. The first is analog only, the second may be either "
"analog or I2C, depending on baseboard jumpers."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板在 6 针接头上有两个专用电源监测接口。正确的电池参数设置取决于所连接的电源模块类型。第一个接口仅支持模拟，第二个接口根据底板跳线可支持模拟或 "
"I2C。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:460 cc3e572811d0485c9db61d00ca601095
msgid ""
"In order to enable monitoring, the :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` or "
":ref:`BATT2_MONITOR<BATT2_MONITOR>` parameter must be set. By default "
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` is set to \"4\" for the included power "
"module.."
msgstr ""
"要启用监测，必须设置 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 或 "
":ref:`BATT2_MONITOR<BATT2_MONITOR>` "
"参数。默认情况下，:ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 已为随机附带的电源模块设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:462 f7c80d545a3a4801aa301ce5b56f4080
msgid ""
"Default params for the first monitor are set and are: * "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 2 * "
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 1 * "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 18.0 * "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 24.0 (may "
"need adjustment if supplied monitor is not used)"
msgstr ""
"第一个监测的默认参数已设置如下：* :ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>`"
" = 2 * :ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 1 * "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 18.0 * "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"24.0（若未使用随机附带的监测模块可能需要调整）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:469 c7e98e78412d4defb37ab313f2ca77e9
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:470 ca5a5f4ed19845b49fd3a93ed8c45906
msgid ""
"The MUPilot has a builtin IST8310 compass. Due to potential interference the"
" board is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a GPS/Compass"
" combination."
msgstr "MUPilot 内置 IST8310 罗盘。由于可能存在干扰，通常搭配外置 I2C 罗盘（作为 GPS/罗盘组合模块的一部分）使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:473 62952d66305544e381cfd3415fb8e5b5
msgid "GPIOs"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:474 b0a6544566fb48f7a3ca3d432b908075
msgid ""
"The 6 auxiliary outputs can be used as GPIOs (relays, buttons, RPM etc). To "
"use them see :ref:`common-gpios`"
msgstr "6 路辅助输出可用作 GPIO（继电器、按钮、转速等）。使用方法请参阅 :ref:`common-gpios`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:476 1089e071f63c4d398e1ff71c80b1191c
msgid ""
"The numbering of the GPIOs for PIN variables in ArduPilot is: * MAIN1 101 * "
"MAIN2 102 * MAIN3 103 * MAIN4 104 * MAIN5 105 * MAIN6 106 * MAIN7 107 * "
"MAIN8 108 * AUX1 50 * AUX2 51 * AUX3 52 * AUX4 53 * AUX5 54 * AUX6 55"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中 PIN 变量的 GPIO 编号如下：* MAIN1 101 * MAIN2 102 * MAIN3 103 * MAIN4 "
"104 * MAIN5 105 * MAIN6 106 * MAIN7 107 * MAIN8 108 * AUX1 50 * AUX2 51 * "
"AUX3 52 * AUX4 53 * AUX5 54 * AUX6 55"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:493 921a956bb5414b82bd3bd823d5fa1e88
msgid "Analog inputs"
msgstr "模拟输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:495 b2876258c8814bf38089e2b0ad39c0e1
msgid ""
"The MUPilot has 7 analog inputs * ADC Pin0 -> Battery Voltage * ADC Pin1 -> "
"Battery Current Sensor * ADC Pin2 -> Battery Voltage 2 * ADC Pin3 -> Battery"
" Current Sensor 2 * ADC Pin4 -> ADC port pin 2 * ADC Pin14 -> ADC port pin 3"
" * ADC Pin10 -> Board 5V Sense * ADC Pin11 -> Board 3.3V Sense * ADC Pin103 "
"-> RSSI voltage monitoring"
msgstr ""
"MUPilot 有 7 路模拟输入：* ADC 引脚 0 -> 电池电压 * ADC 引脚 1 -> 电池电流传感器 * ADC 引脚 2 -> "
"电池电压 2 * ADC 引脚 3 -> 电池电流传感器 2 * ADC 引脚 4 -> ADC 端口引脚 2 * ADC 引脚 14 -> ADC "
"端口引脚 3 * ADC 引脚 10 -> 板载 5V 检测 * ADC 引脚 11 -> 板载 3.3V 检测 * ADC 引脚 103 -> "
"RSSI 电压监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:507 440a4d3332a44eb4aeb131080588f14d
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MUPilot.rst:508 5208e177ac694962b331982192b24684
msgid ""
"The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot compatible bootloader, "
"allowing the loading of \\*.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot compatible"
" ground station."
msgstr "该飞控板预装了兼容 ArduPilot 的引导程序，可使用任何 ArduPilot 兼容地面站加载 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
